      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Cancer is a complex, multilevel phenomenon [1-5] in which health outcomes depend on highly interrelated elements across stages of etiology, prevention, screening, diagnosis, treatment, survivorship, and end-of-life care [6, 7]. Standard bench and clinical research approaches alone are not well suited to account for this complexity... The extent to which system dynamics modeling has been applied specifically to cancer prevention and control has not been studied.",
      "reason": "The text describes the current state of knowledge (cancer is complex, standard approaches not well suited) and important uncertainties (extent of SD modeling application in cancer prevention/control has not been studied)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "To overcome persistent barriers to providing high-quality, equitable care, approaches are needed to address this complexity and provide guidance for successful intervention... The extent to which system dynamics modeling has been applied specifically to cancer prevention and control has not been studied.",
      "reason": "The text explains the importance and need for the review by highlighting the need to overcome barriers and addressing the gap that the extent of SD modeling application in cancer prevention/control has not been studied."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "The extent to which system dynamics modeling has been applied specifically to cancer prevention and control has not been studied.",
      "reason": "The text states that the extent to which SD modeling has been applied to cancer prevention and control has not been studied, implying no similar systematic review exists to update or replicate."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The study was not registered in the International Prospective Register of Systematic Reviews (PROSPERO) as it was a methods review and did not assess health outcomes.",
      "reason": "The review is a methods review of system dynamics modeling studies, not a review of intervention effects, so the mechanism of action of an intervention is not applicable."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "The study was not registered in the International Prospective Register of Systematic Reviews (PROSPERO) as it was a methods review and did not assess health outcomes.",
      "reason": "The review focuses on modeling studies rather than complex interventions, making the consideration of a logic model for intervention components and outcomes not applicable."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
